data: {"id": "e39552678dfb47de-thinking-parallel_evidence-1457", "run_id": "e39552678dfb47de", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Topology 查询已成功。现在总结本轮结果：\n\n**已采集事实：**\n- Pod UID: `546ed0f3-c379-4bda-a2fe-3ffbf1b916a2`\n- 所在节点: `node2`\n- 控制器关系: Pod → ReplicaSet `workload-5dbb5dcd6c` → Deployment `workload`\n- 容器: `app`\n\n`query_pod_topology` 工具之前因 \"Connection closed\" 报错，修正后重新调用已成功返回完整拓扑关系，包括 pod_ip（从上下文可知）、调度节点和所有层级控制器。无需再次重试。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789064454383, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

